'''Necromancer [[Krytan armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as [[Necromancer collector armor|collector armor]] and is also available for crafting in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': Necromancer Krytan armor art does not have headgear, but the [[Necromancer Ragged Scar Pattern]] is available from the same armorer in Factions. In Prophecies the same scar pattern is available from collectors.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Krytan armor.

